#: drivepage.cpp:26
msgid ""
"Ok, now we should add some nice icons for your disc and cdrom drives to the "
"desktop. You just have to click the drive icon to create/delete the icon. In "
"rare cases, it will be necessary to correct the drive info."
msgstr ""
"Lekka! Ons gaan nou 'n paar mooi ikone vir u skyf- en CDROM-aandrywers op die "
"werkskerms plaas. U moet net op die dryfikoon kliek dit te skep/verwyder.In rare "
"gevalle mag dit nodig wees om die dryfinligting te korrigeer."

#: drivepage.cpp:36
msgid "1st Floppy Disc drive"
msgstr "1ste Floppie Skyfaandrywer"

#: drivepage.cpp:52
msgid "2nd Floppy Disc drive"
msgstr "2de Floppie Skyfaandrywer"

#: drivepage.cpp:68
msgid "CD-ROM drive"
msgstr "CD-ROM Aandrywer"

#: drivepage.cpp:92 drivepage.cpp:98
msgid "Floppy disc"
msgstr "Floppie skyfaandrywer"

#: drivepage.cpp:104
msgid "CD-ROM"
msgstr "CD-ROM"

#: linkpage.cpp:29
msgid ""
"Finally, I would advise you to create some links to important ressources on "
"the net for you. All information about KDE will be only one mouseclick away. "
"Just click the icon to create the link."
msgstr ""
"Laastens, wil ek u adviseer oor die skep van skakels na 'n aantal belangrike "
"hulpbronne op die 'net. Alle inligting oor KDE ssal net een muiskliek ver wees. "
"Kliek net die ikoon om die skakel te skep."

#: linkpage.cpp:38
msgid "The KDE homepage"
msgstr "Die KDE webwerf"

#: linkpage.cpp:50
msgid "The KDE FTP server"
msgstr "Die KDE FTP-bediener"

#: linkpage.cpp:62
msgid "KDE Developers site"
msgstr "KDE Ontwikkelaarswerf"

#: printerpage.cpp:26
msgid ""
"You will propably have a printer, don't you? Then why not create a little "
"icon for the printer that allows you to drag & drop files to the printer, "
"and to invoke the printer queue utility!"
msgstr ""
"U het heelwaarskynlik 'n drukker. Waarom dan nie 'n klein ikoon vir die "
"drukker nie? Ene wat u toelaat om sommer lêers daarop te laat val wat dan "
"gedruk sal word!"

#: printerpage.cpp:35
msgid "Printer icon"
msgstr "Drukkerikoon"

